# Popup backdrop

Every popup focuses the dialog by blurring the page behind it. The reference is the line dialog on `/finance/expenses/new?manual=1`.

- Open the popup with `GlassDialog` from `components/glass`. Do not build a separate full-screen overlay.
- The backdrop is the shared scrim in `GlassDialog`: a dim layer plus `backdrop-blur-md`. Do not remove the blur for a `solid` dialog. `solid` only makes the dialog panel opaque so text and buttons stay readable.
- Keep the panel above the scrim. Do not put the blur on the panel itself.
- A second popup that opens on top of the first uses `GlassDialog` too, so it gets the same scrim.
